<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Esta</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Esta</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esta</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esta</para>
  <para style="mt2">SHITABU SHA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESTA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoleru</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Esta shitakulira ntambu gaa Waisraeli waweriti wamanda aku Perisia na ntambu yawalopolitwi kulawa kwa mnkondu yakafiriti kuwalaga. Tembera litawu lya Mlungu likantitwindiri mushitabu sha Esta, handa Mlungu kawalopoliti kulawa kumlandu agu gwa kuwalaga womberi. Kwahera muntu yakalembiti shitabu sha Esta, kwa kulola ntambu ya luga ya Shiebrania yayitenderitwi. Wabetula wavuwa walihola handa shitabu sha Esta shirembwa mushinja sha miya na msheshi pamberi pa Kristu kwiwuka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malawiru yagatakulwa mushitabu ashi sha Esta galanguziya msambu gwa Wayahudi yagushemwa Purimi ntambu yagwanjiti. Muntu yumu gwa Amaleki yakamanikiti kwa litawu lya Hamani katenditi mpangu gwa kuwalaga Wayahudi. Toziya Waisraeli na Waamaleki waweriti na unkondu kwanjira Waisraeli pawanjiti mwanja kushiwala mpaka kusoka kuisi irii Mlungu kawagambiriti hakawapanani. (Kul 17:8-16). Shaka shiraashi Hamani kapangiti kuwalaga Wayahudi, Esta yakaweriti Myahudi kaweriti malikiya gwa Perisia. Na Modekayi yakaweriti mlongu gwakuyi Esta kampananiti ugambiziya wa mpangu gwa Hamani. Pa Wayahudi kuwakanka wankondu wawu Esta 9:20-22, Modekai kawagambiriti wantu wakuyi wanemeleri ukanka awu. Hangu ndo Wayahudi ntambu yawanjiti kutenda msambu gwa Purimu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Esta ntambu yakaweriti malikiya gwa Perisia mushipandi sha kwanja mpaka shapili.</para>
  <para style="io">Mpangu gwa Hamani gwa kuwalaga Wayahudi na ntambu yakalagitwi kwa kutenda hangu mushipandi sha kwanja na shapili.</para>
  <para style="io">Wayahudi ntambu yawawakankiti wankondu wawu na kwanja kutenda msambu gwa Purimu shipandi sha kwanja na shapili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Ahasuero kankumuwinga malikiya Vashiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1" />Ali ndo lyalilawiriti shaka sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Ahasuero, mweni kakolitimlima mikowa miya ishilini na saba, kwanjira India mpaka Isiopia. <verse eid="EST 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2" />Kayikolitimlima mikowa ayi agawu mweni pakawera kalikala kumji gwa Susa.<verse eid="EST 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" />Mshinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wakuyi, Mfalumi Ahasuero kawatenderiti msambu walonguziya na wantumintumi wakuyi na wakulu wa mashonta wa Perisia na Mediya na wana wa wafalumi na wakulu wa miji. <verse eid="EST 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />Kwa shaka sha miyezi sita, mfalumi Ahasuero kalanguziya uvuwa wa ulunda wa ufalumi wakuyi na ukwisa wa ukolamlima wakuyi.<verse eid="EST 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Mashaka aga pagaperiti, Mfalumi kawatenderiti msambu wantu woseri wa mji gwa Susa, wakulu kwa wadidini. Msambu agu guweriti gwa mashaka saba, gutendikiti kuligeleri lya shiwunga sha liboma lya mfalumi. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Pahala panu paweriti paherepeziwa kwa mapaziya mafufu na ga langi ya buluwu. Mapaziya aga ga pamba gaweriti gatawalirwa kwa ngoyi nfufu na zambalawu na kukowekwa mumpanda za mabuhi yagalembitwi malumalu. Na viti vya zahabu viweriti vitulwa musakafu yayinyawitwi kwa mabuhi ga rangi na mabuhi ga malumalu na mabuhi mafufu na mabuhi gamonga. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Wantu walanditi divayi yayitulitwi muvikombi vya zahabu vya ntambu yingiyingi, yomberi kaweritindiri kawapananiti divayi ya shifalumi. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Kila muntu kalanditi na kutosiya, toziya mfalumi kawalagaliriti wantumintumi wa numba ya shifalumi, wampanani kila muntu shakaweziti kulanda.<verse eid="EST 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />Shaka shiraa ashi, malikiya Vashiti kawatenderiti msambu wadala yawaweriti mliboma lya mfalumi Ahasuero.<verse eid="EST 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />Mulishaka lya saba lya msambu agu, mfalumi Ahasuero, pakawera na nemeru nentu kwa kulanda divayi, kawashemiti matowashi saba yawamtendiriti yomberi gweka yakuyi, Mehumani na Bizata na Haribona na Bigita na Abagita na Zetari na Karikasi. <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" />Kawalagaliriti wantumintumi awa wamjegi malikiya Vashiti mdala gwakuyi, pakawera kavala lijenjeri lyakuyi lya shimalikiya. Malikiya ayu kaweriti na sheni sha kuherepiziya nentu, hangu mfalumi kafiliti kuwalanguziya wahenga wakuyi na walonguziya uherepa wa malikiya ayu. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Kumbiti wantumintumi awa pawamgambiriti malikiya shilii shawalagaliritwi na mfalumi, malikiya Vashiti kalemiti kugenda. Shitwatira ashi shimkalaziyiti nentu mfalumi.<verse eid="EST 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13" />Iweriti shitiba sha mfalumi kupata ugambiziwu kulawa kwa wanaluhala, hangu kawashemiti wantu wa lagiru na wamahakimu su wamgambiziyi shakutenda. <verse eid="EST 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14" />Wagambiziya wakuyi wapakwegera waweriti Karishena na Shetari na Adimata na Tarishishi na Maresi na Marisena na Memukani, awa waweriti walonguziya saba wa Perisia na Mediya yawaweriti wakulu muukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="EST 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Kawakosiyiti hangu, lagiru lilonga hashi, katenderwi shishi malikiya Vashiti? “Toziya niwalagaliriti wantumintumi waneni kwakuyi, kumbiti yomberi kalemiti lagalira ya neni, neni mfalumi Ahasuero?”<verse eid="EST 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Shakapanu Memukani kankula kulongolu kwa mfalumi na wakulu, “Malikiya Vashiti kankoseya nentu, kamkoseya ndiri mfalumi gweka yakuyi kumbiti viraavirii kawakoseya wakulu woseri na wantu woseri yawawera muisi ya mfalumi Ahasuero! <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Mlandu agu gwakatenditi malikiya Vashiti pagumanika kwa wadala woseri na womberi hawawabeziyi wapalu wawu. Shakapanu hawalongi, mfalumi Ahasuero kalagaliriti malikiya Vashiti kajegwi kulongolu kwakuyi, kumbiti yomberi kalemiti. <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Leru ayi, wadala wa wakulu wa Perisia na Mediya weni yawapikiniriti gakatenditi malikiya Vashiti, hawalongi hangu kwa wakulu woseri, hangu su hawatubeziyi na twenga hatuwawoneri maya. <verse eid="EST 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" />Vinu gwenga mfalumi, paguwona ndo iherepa, gulagaliri Vashiti nakiza kayi palongolu paku, lagiru ayi ilembwi mulagiru za Perisia na Media, su nayigalambulwa. Shakapanu umalikiya wakuyi kapananwi mdala yumonga yakaherepa kuliku yomberi. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" />Lilagaliru ali lya mfalumi palibwerwa kila pahala muukolamlima wakuyi, wadala woseri hawawapikiniri wapalu wawu, yakawera mlunda ama mhushu.”<verse eid="EST 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Liholu ali limfiriziya nentu mfalumi na wakulu na yomberi katenda ntambu yakatakuliti Memukani. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" />Su, mfalumi kapelekiti barua mukila mkowa pakakolitimlima kwa luga yawu na ntambu yawalemba, handa kila mpalu kaweri mlonguziya gwa kaya yakuyi na kushibwera shisoweru ashi kwa luga yakuyi.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s">Esta kankusyagulwa kaweri malikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Maya ga mfalumi Ahasuero pagapeliti, mfalumi kamholiti Vashiti na kaweriti kankulihola galii gakagatenditi na galii gakalagaliriti katenderwi Vashiti. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" />Su, wantumintumi wakuyi yawaweriti wankumtendera yomberi gweka yakuyi, “Wamgambiziya, wana wali yawamanandiri mpalu wavuwa waherepa, ntambu gaa tukusakulili yumu kaweri mdala gwaku? <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />Guweza kuwasyagula wakulu mukila mkowa gwagukolamlima, guwalagaliri wawajegi wali yawamanandiri wapalu, woseri waherepa kunumba yawalikala wadala yayiwera kumji gwa Susa. Shakapanu walolerwi na Hegai, ntumintumi gwa mfalumi na mlolera gwa wadala waku na kawapanani vintu vyoseri vyakuliheripiziya. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Ulii yakakufiriziya nentu na katendwi malikiya pahala pa Vashiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 2:4">Mfalumi kawoniti magambiziya aga ndo gahelepa, katenda hangu.”<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />Kumji gwa Susa, kuweriti na muntu yumu Myahudi, litawu lyakuyi Modekai, Modekai kaweriti mwana gwa Yairi, Yairi kaweriti mwana gwa Shimei na Shimei kaweriti mwana gwa Kishi gwa likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" />Modekai kaweriti yumu gwa wantu yawatolitwi kulawa muisi ya umanda shaka mfalumi Yekoniya gwa Yuda pakabatitwi na Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babeli. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Modekai kaweriti na mwipa yawamshemiti Esta kwa shiebrania kashemitwi Hadasa. Esta kaweriti na nshimba iherepa na sheni shiherepa, Modekai kamleriti mhinga ayu gambira mwana gwakuyi mweni pa walera wakuyi kuhowa.<verse eid="EST 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Lagaliru lya mfalumi palibweritwi wahinga wavuwa wajegitwi kumji gwa Susa, watulitwi su walerwi na Hegai. Esta nayomberi, kajegitwi kuliboma lya mfalumi na kalerwi na Hegai, mlera ayu gwa wadala. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Hegai kafiliziwitwi na Esta ata kamtendera maheri. Hegai katenditi kalongola kumpanana Esta lipaki na shiboga shiherepa. Shakapanu kamtulira pahala paherepa munumba ayi ya wadala, kamsyagulira wantumintumi wa shidala saba kulawa munumba ya mfalumi wamntenderi.<verse eid="EST 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Esta kaweriti kenilimaniziyi lukolu lyakuyi pota likabila lyakuyi, toziya Modekai kaweriti kamberiziya nakatenda hangu. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Kila lishaka Modekai kapitapita kulongolu kwa ligeleri lya numba ayi ya wadala su kavimana ntambu yakendeleya Esta na mirandu yayimlawira.<verse eid="EST 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Shaka sha kulihelepeziya shiweriti shinja shimu. Kwa miyezi sita waweriti wankuliswaga lipaki lya manimani na miezi sita ya kuliswaga lipaki na utuli. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Pawaweriti wankugenda kwa mfalumi, kila mhinga kapananitwi kila shintu shakafiriti mumahelipiziya gakuyi kulawa numba ya wadala kugenda nashi kuliboma. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" />Mhinga kagenda pashimihi na mandawira kawuya kunumba imonga ya wadala yayigolokerwa na Shaashigazi. Shaashigazi kaweriti ntumintumi mgolokera gwa wadala wamonga wa mfalumi. Mhinga kawezandiri kuwuya kayi kwa mfalumi, mpaka mfalumi kamfili na kulagalira kashemwi kwa litawu lyakuyi.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Shisokiti shaka sha Esta kugenda kwa mfalumi. Ayu Esta kaweriti mhinga gwa Abihaili na mwipa gwa Modekai viraa kalelitwi na Modekai, kaluwitindiri shoseri nentu ya shilii shakalongiti Hegai, ntumintumi mlolera gwa wadala wa mfalumi kashivali. Kila muntu yakamwoniti Esta, kafiliziwa na yomberi. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Su, Esta kajegwa kuliboma lya mfalumi mushinja sha saba sha ukolamlima wa Mfalumi Ahasuero, mwezi gwa lilongu yagushemitwi Tebeti. <verse eid="EST 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" />Mfalumi kafiliziwa nentu na Esta kuliku ntambu yakawafiriti wadala wamonga woseri. Kamfiliti nentu kuliku wali wamonga walii. Su, mfalumi kamvalasiya lijenjeri lya shimalikiya kumtuyi, kamtenda kaweri malikiya pa Vashiti. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamtendiriti Esta msambu mkulu, kawashemera walonguziya na wantumintumi woseri wa ufalumi wakuyi. Viravirii, kawafupiti wantu vintu vivuwa vyavilinganira na manemu ga shifalumi.<verse eid="EST 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Modekai kankumlopola mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Wahinga pawajojonikiti kayi, Mushaka ashi Modekai kaweriti kasyagulwa kuwela mkulu muufalumi. <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />Esta kaweriti hakenilimaniziyi handa kalawa likabila gaa na lukolu gaa. Katenditi handa Modekai ntambu yakamlagaliriti toziya Esta kaweriti kamjimira Modekai ntambu yakamjimiriti pakaweriti kankumlera.<verse eid="EST 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />Modekai pakaweriti kalikala paligomi likulu lya mfalumi, Bigitana na Tereshi, wakulu wawili wa mfalumi yawaweriti walolera wa migomi ya vyumba vya mfalumi, wakalaziwa mpaka wafiriti kumlaga mfalumi Ahasuero. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" />Modekai kavimaniti mlandu agu, kamgambira malikiya Esta na Esta kamgambira mfalumi. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" />Pawaweriti wankugulola mlandu agu, imanikiti handa nakaka. Su, wantu wawili awa wapingikwa kumtera gwa kulagira na mlandu agu gulembitwi mushitabu sha maholu kulongolu kwa mfalumi.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s">Hamani kankupanga kuwalaga Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />Pagaperiti aga, mfalumi Ahasuero kampananiti Hamani mwana gwa Hamedata gwa wiwuka wa Agagi, yakaweriti mkulu nentu kuliku wakulu woseri. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" />Wakulu woseri wa ufalumi wakuyi wampikiniri Hamani kwa kumng'ong'onalira na kumsuntamalira. Kumbiti Modekai, kamng'ong'onalira ndiri pota kumlamsiya. <verse eid="EST 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />“Wamu wa walongoziya wa mfalumi yawaweriti paligomi likulu lya mfalumi, wamkosiya Modekai, hashi gwenga gulibeziya lilagaliru lya mfalumi?” <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />Kila lishaka waweriti wamgambiziya kaleki kutenda hangu, kumbiti Modekai kawapikanirandiri. Modekai kalemiti kutenda hangu toziya yomberi ndo Myahudi na kawezandiri kumsuntamalira Hamani. Su, wamgambira Hamani kawoni handa kaweza kumhepelera Modekai. <verse eid="EST 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Hamani kaweriti na maya pakavimaniti handa Modekai kamng'ong'onalira ndiri na pota kumsuntamalira. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />Pakayambuliti handa Modekai kaweriti Myahudi, kawoniti iherepandiri kamlagi gweka yakuyi. Su katenda mpangu kuwalaga Wayahudi woseri, yawaweriti muukolamlima wa mfalumi Ahasuero.<verse eid="EST 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />Mushinja sha kumi na mbili sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Ahasuero, mumwezi gwa kwanja yagushemwa Nisani, Hamani kalagalira wantu wagalambuli simbi wamuwi lishaka na mwezi gweni gutendeki mpangu gwakuyi. Su, simbi itulukira lishaka lya kumi na msheshi lya mwezi gwa kumi na mbili yagushemitwi Adari.<verse eid="EST 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" />Shakapanu, Hamani kamgambira Mfalumi Ahasuero. “Kwana wantu wa isi tunga yawawera kila pahala muukolamlima waku. Wantu awa wanalagiru yazilifanandiri na lagiru za isi yetu. Viravirii womberi wazijimirandiri lagiru zyaku, hangu mona mfalumi naguwahepelera. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Pagufira, gwee mfalumi, gulagaliri wantu awa walaguwi. Naneni ntakula, handa pagulagalira hangu, handaviyi kilu selasini na saba elufu na miya mhanu za mpiya zitulwi mluhanja lwa mfalumi guwalipi wantu yawafira kutenda hangu.”<verse eid="EST 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" />Mfalumi kayivula peti yakuyi, yayitenderitwi kutulira shimaniziwu na kampanana mnkondu gwa Wayahudi Hamani mwana gwa Hamedata yakalawa muwiwuka wa Agagi. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamgambira “Hamani, gusigali na senti zaku na guwatenderi wantu awa ntambu yagufira,”<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />Su, lishaka lya kumi na tatu lya mwezi gwa kwanja, Hamani kawashemiti walemba woseri wa mfalumi, kawapanana libweru lyalifiritwi litafsiliwi kwa kila luga na kila ntambu ya malembu ga wantu wa ufalumi awu, shakapanu libweru ali lijegwi kwa wakolamlima woseri wa mfalumi, wakulu wa mikowa yoseri na wakulu wa makabila goseri na kila isi kwa luga yawu. Libweru ali lilembwitwi kwa litawu lya mfalumi Ahasuero na kutulwa shimaniziwu kwa peti yakuyi. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" />Walagilagi wajegiti baluwa azi kwa kila mkowa muukolamlima awu. Libweru ali lilonga handa kwa lishaka limu hera, ndo lishaka lya kumi na tatu lya mwezi gwa kumi na mbili yagushemwa Adari, Wayahudi woseri wantemba kwa wazewi, wadala kwa wana, woseri wafiruwa kulagwa na lunda zawu zoseri zitolwi. <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" />Nakala ya baluwa ayi ya lagiru ifiritwi kulaviwa gambira lagaliru mukila mji na kumaniziwa muisi su wawezi kuwera kala kwa lishaka ali.<verse eid="EST 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Libweru ali lilaviwitwi mumji mkulu gwa Susa handa mfalumi ntambu yakalagaliriti. Na walagilagi wabweriti mumikowa yoseri. Mfalumi na Hamani walikala pasi pawalanda agawu wantu wa Susa pawawera wankuhinginika.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s">Modekai kamluwa Esta kamtangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />Modekai pakavimaniti goseri yagalawiriti, kazipapuliti nguwu zakuyi, kavala nguwu za malobota na pakalityeremeka malivu. Shakapanu, kapita pakati pamji pakalira kwa hinginika na kwa kubotanga. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Kagenditi na kugoloka kunja kuligomi lya mfalumi, toziya kwahera muntu yakajimilitwi kwingira kuliboma pakawera kavala lilobota. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" />Mukila mkowa lagiru lya mfalumi payibweritwi, kuweriti na shiwembu shikulu muwamu mwa Wayahudi. Waliyitindiri shoseri, walira na kudaya na wantu wavuwa muwamu wagonjiti mumalivu agawu pawavala malobota.<verse eid="EST 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Malikiya Esta pakagambiritwi na wantumintumi wakuyi visoweru vya Modekai, kinginikiti nentu. Kamjegera Modekai nguwu za kuvala pa nguwu za mafafa, kumbiti Modekai kazilema. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Shakapanu, kamshema Hataki, yumu gwa wasaulwa wa mfalumi yakasyagulitwi na mfalumi kamtenderi Esta, kamlagalira kwa Modekai kamkosiyi kwanashishi shashilawiliti. <verse eid="EST 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Shakapanu Hataki kamgendera Modekai kuluwaga, kulongolu kuligomi likulu lya mfalumi. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" />Modekai kamgambira Hataki goseri yagaweriti gampata na shiyasi sha mpiya sheni Hamani kaweriti katakuliti kulaviya muluhanja lwa mfalumi handa Wayahudi woseri mewalaguwi. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" />Kampanana viraa nakala ya baluwa yimu ya libweru yayilaviwitwi kumji gwa Susa toziya ya kwagamiziwa kwa Wayahudi, kamluwa Hataki kamjegeri Esta baluwa ayi na kamgambili goseri, shakapanu kamgambira kagendi kamluwi mfalumi na kamluwi kawawoneri lusungu Wayahudi, wantu wakuyi Esta. <verse eid="EST 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Hangu Hataki kagenda kumgambira Esta goseri gakalongiti Modekai. <verse eid="EST 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />Shakapanu Esta kamgambira Hataki kawuyi kumgambira Modekai hangu, <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" />“Wantumintumi woseri wa mfalumi na wantu wa miji yoseri wavimana nakamu kuwera mpalu ama mdala yoseri ulii yakingira muligeleri lya mngati na kumwona mfalumi pota kushemwa, ayu kalaguwi. Yakaweza kuponeka ndo ulii mweni mfalumi hakamnyosheri luhonga lwakuyi lwa shifalumi lwa zahabu su kumponiziya. Naneni nshemwandiri na mfalumi, mwezi goseri agu.”<verse eid="EST 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Modekai pakapatiti ulagilagi ulii wa Esta, <verse eid="EST 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />Modekai kawuziyiti lyakulu ali, “Nagulihola toziya gwamnumba ya mfalumi gwenga gamweni haguponeki kuliku Wayahudi woseri. <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" />Pagulikala jii mushaka ashi, Wayahudi hawatangwi kulawa kwa wantu wamonga, nawomberi hawalopolwi na gwenga haguhowi na walongu wa tati gwaku hawalaguwi. Ndo gaa yakavimana kuwera gutendwa malikiya toziya ya shaka handa ashi!”<verse eid="EST 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Shakapanu Esta kamjegeriti Modekai lyankulu ali, <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />“Gugendi gwakawajojoniri pamuhera Wayahudi woseri yawawera kumji gwa Susa. Moyi kuliya toziya ya neni, namliya ama kulanda kwa mashaka matatu, pashiru na paluwala. Neni na wantumintumi wangu wadala hatutendi ntambu iraayi. Shakapanu hanimgenderi mfalumi, tembera lagiru libera kutenda hangu. Handa kulaguwa ndaguwi.”<verse eid="EST 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Su, Modekai kagenda na kutenda handa Esta ntambu yakamgambiriti.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s">Esta kankuwashemera mfalumi na Hamani kumsambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Lishaka lya tatu Esta kavaliti nguwu yakuyi ya shimalikiya, kagenda kagoloka muligeleri lya mngati mwa numba ya mfalumi, kulongolu muukumbi wa mfalumi. Mfalumi kaweriti mngati, kalivaga mushiti shakuyi sha ukolamlima, pakalola ligomi lya kwingilira. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" />Mfalumi pakamwoniti malikiya Esta kagoloka kuligeleri, kafiliziwa nayomberi, kamtalipisiya luhonga lwa zahabu lwaluweriti kalukola mumawoku mwakuyi. Esta kasegelera, kashinkula upeleru wa luhonga alu. <verse eid="EST 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamkosiya, “Gufira shishi Esta? Gung'ambili shagufira na gwenga hagupati ata nusu ya ufalumi wa neni.”<verse eid="EST 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Esta kamwankula, “Payikufiriziya mfalumi, gwenga na Hamani mwizi leru mumsambu yanigutanditi toziya yaku.”<verse eid="EST 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Mfalumi kalagalira Hamani kashemwi kalongola gambira Esta ntambu yakaluwiti. “Su, mfalumi na Hamani wagenda kumsambu gwakatanditi Esta.” <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Pawaweriti wankulanda divayi, mfalumi kamkosiya kayi Esta, “Vinu gung'ambiri gufira shishi Esta? Na gwenga hagupati ata nusu ya ufalumi wa neni.”<verse eid="EST 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Esta kamwankula, “Luwa yaneni ndo ayi, <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />handa pagufiriziwa, gwee mfalumi, kujimiri luwa ya neni, su, nduwa gwenga na Hamani mwizi shirawu kumsambu gumonga, panu hanikugambiri shanfira.”<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamani kankupanga kumlaga Modekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />Hamani kalawa kumsambu agawu pakanemelera. Kumbiti pakamwoniti Modekai paligomi lya mfalumi kuwera kagolokandiri pota kulendemera, Hamani kaniti maya. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Ata hangu, kalileweleriti, kagenda ukaya. Shakapanu kawashemera ukaya kwakuyi waganja wakuyi na kumluwa Zereshi mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" />Hangu Hamani kalitumbira ulunda wakuyi uvuwa, wana wapalu wavuwa yakaweriti nawa na mfalumi ntambu yakamkweniziyiti muukulu kuliku wamonga. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Hamani kandereya kulitumba, kalongiti hangu, “ Nentu ya aga malikiya Esta kamshemerandiri muntu gwingi yoseri ira neni nililonguziyi na mfalumi. Viraa shirawu katushemera neni na mfalumi tugendi kumsambu. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" />Kumbiti goseri aga ganyamaziyandiri handa panendereya kumwona Myahudi Modekai paligomi likulu lya mfalumi.”<verse eid="EST 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Hangu, Zereshi mdala gwakuyi na waganja wakuyi, wamgambiziya, “Kanyawirwi mtera gwa kulagira yaguwera na utali wa mita ishilini na mbili, shirawu mandawira, guyoweri na mfalumi su Modekai kalaguwi pampindi pa mtera agu, shakapanu gugendi kumsambu na mfalumi agawu paguwera na manemu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:14">Liholu ali limnemeziyiti Hamani na yomberi kagugolosiya mtera gwa kulagira.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi kankumpanana modekai ligoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />Pashiru palii, mfalumi kagonjandiri mpota. Su, kalagalira shitabu sha maholu ga malawiru ga kila lishaka muukolamlima wakuyi shijegwi, shakapanu shibetulwa kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" />Mukusoma aku iwoneka pahala papalembitwi kuwera Modekai ntambu yakavimaniti mpangu gwa Bigitana na Tereshi, wantumintumi wawili wa mfalumi yawaweriti wankulolera ligomi likulu lya mfalumi wapangiti kumlaga mfalumi Ahasuero. <verse eid="EST 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Mfalumi kakosiya, “Hashi, tumpanani Modekai ligoya gaa ama tumfupi shintu gaa kwa shitwatira ashi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:3">Wantumintumi wakuyi wamwankula, “Hagweni mtenderi shintu shoseri toziya yakuyi.”<verse eid="EST 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" />Mfalumi kakosiya, “Kwana mkulu yoseri paukumbi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:4">Shaka ashi Hamani kaweriti kingira muligeleri lya kunja lya liboma. Kiziti kwa mfalumi kuluwa Modekai kalaguwi kumtera agu gwakanyawiti kala. <verse eid="EST 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Su, wantumintumi wamwankula mfalumi, “Hamani ndo yakawera paukumbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:5">Mfalumi kawagambira, “Mmugambiri kingiri mngati.”<verse eid="EST 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Hamani pakingiriti mngati, mfalumi kamkosiya, “Hashi, nimtenderi shishi muntu mweni menfiri nentu kumpanana ligoya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:6">Hamani kalihola mumoyu mwakuyi. Ndo gaa ayu mweni mfalumi mekafiri kumpanana ligoya nentu kuliku neni.<verse eid="EST 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7" />Su, “Hamani kamwankula mfalumi, muntu ayu mfalumi mekafiri kumpanana ligoya, <verse eid="EST 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8" />ndo iherepa wantumintumi waku wajegi nguwu zazinyawitwi kwa shitambala shifufu shiherepa shakavaliti mfalumi na farasi gwakuyi yakamkweniti mfalumi na kavalasiwi lijenjeri lya shifalumi pamtuyi pakuyi, <verse eid="EST 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" />shakapanu lihabiti na farasi wampanani yumu gwa wantumintumi wakulu wa mfalumi yakagoyika nentu, nawomberi wamvalasiyi muntu uli mweni mfalumi kafira kumpanana ligoya na kalonguziwi pakawera pampindi pa farasi kupita njira zya mji, pawambwera kulongolu kwakuyi, hangu ndo ntambu yakatenderwa muntu mweni mfalumi kafira kumpanana ligoya.”<verse eid="EST 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamlagalira Hamani, gutendi kalongola! “Gutoli nguwu azi na farasi, gwakampanani ligoya ali Modekai, Myahudi yakalikala paligomi likulu lya mfalumi. Naguleka kutenda ata shintu shimu muaga gagung'ambiriti.”<verse eid="EST 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Su, Hamani katola nguwu azi na kumvalasiya Modekai, kamtyangaziya kunjira zya mji pakawera pampindi pa farasi gwa mfalumi, agawu pakabwera. “Hangu ndo ntambu yakatenderwa muntu ulii mfalumi kafira kumpanana ligoya.”<verse eid="EST 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Shakapanu Modekai kawuya kuligomi likulu lya mfalumi. Kumbiti Hamani katugira ukaya kwakuyi, agawu pakahinginika na kugibikira sheni shakuyi kwa soni. <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />Su kawagambira Zereshi mdala gwakuyi na waganja wakuyi woseri mirandu yoseri yayimpatiti. “Zereshi na waganja wakuyi wamgambira, payiwera Modekai ayu, mweni gwenga gwanja kwagamiziya ukulu waku kwakuyi na mweni ndo Myahudi, gwenga hapeni gumwezi na hakakukanki nakamu.”<verse eid="EST 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamani kankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" />Pawaweriti wankali wankuyowera nayu, wantumintumi wa mfalumi wasoka kumtola Hamani kalongola kugenda kumsambu gwakatanditi Esta.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Su mfalumi na Hamani wagenda kwa malikiya Esta, kuliya shiboga. <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" />Pawaweriti wankulanda divayi mulishaka lya pili, mfalumi kamkosiya kayi Esta, “Gufira shishi Esta? Gung'ambili shagufira neni hanikupanani ata nusu ya ufalumi wa neni.”<verse eid="EST 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Shakapanu malikiya Esta kamwankula, “Gwee mfalumi handa paguwona ndo iherepa guntenderi shanikuluwa, nduwa neni nendeleyi kulikala, na wantu wangu viraa wendeleyi kulikala. <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" />Toziya, neni na wantu wangu tushuwuzwa na kulaguwa. Handa metushuwuzwi tuweri wamanda wapalu na wadala, menilikali jii, toziya ya shitwatira handa ashi meyiwezindiri kukugaziya mfalumi, kumbiti tufiruwa kulaguwa.”<verse eid="EST 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Shakapanu mfalumi Ahasuero kamkosiyiti malikiya Esta, “Ndo gaa ayu yakajera kutenda mlandu handa agu? Kakoshi muntu ayu?”<verse eid="EST 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Esta kankula, “Mnkondu gwetu mkulu na yakatutabisiya, ndo ayu mkontola Hamani!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:6">Panu Hamani kanjiti kutira kulongolu kwa mfalumi na malikiya.<verse eid="EST 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Mfalumi kagoloka kwa maya, kaleka divayi yakuyi na kugenda kunja kushiwunga sha liboma lya shifalumi. Kumbiti Hamani pakavimaniti handa mfalumi kafira kumkomanga, kasigala kumbeli su kamluwi malikiya Esta kawuponiziyi ukomu wakuyi. <verse eid="EST 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Shakapanu mfalumi pakawuyiti kulawa kushiwunga sha liboma lya shifalumi na kwingira pawukumbi wa msambu, kamwona Hamani kaliyasa pakwegera na shiti shakalivagiti Esta. Pakawoniti hangu, mfalumi katakuliti kwa kubota, “Hashi muntu ayu kafira kumkola kwa makakala malikiya kulongolu kwa neni, kayi mngati mwa liboma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Katepu mfalumi hakeni maliri kulonga, wantumintumi wa mfalumi wamgibikira Hamani kusheni. <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" />Shakapanu Haribona, yumu gwa ntumintumi walii yawamtendera mfalumi, kalonga, “Gwee mfalumi, Hamani kagunyawa mtera gwa kumlagira Modekai muntu yakaulopoliti ukomu waku, mtera agu gwana utali wa mita ishilini na mbili, gwankali gwa aku ukaya kwakuyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Panu mfalumi kalagalira, “Mumukongeri Hamani mumtera agu.”<verse eid="EST 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" />Hangu Hamani kakongerwa kumtera gwa kulagira gwakaweriti kamtandira Modekai. Su maya ga mfalumi ganyamalira.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="s">Wayawudi wankugambirwa wawuziliri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />Lishaka liraali, mfalumi Ahasuero kampanana malikiya Esta lunda yoseri ya Hamani, mweni kaweriti mnkondu gwa Wayahudi. Esta kamgambira mfalumi kuwera Modekai ndo mlongu gwangu. Su, kwanjira shaka ashi, Modekai kajimiluwa kumlola mfalumi. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" />Mfalumi kayivula peti yakuyi ya shimaniziwu yakaweriti kampoka Hamani, kampanana Modekai. Esta kamsyagula Modekai kaweri mkulu gwa lunda ya Hamani.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />Shakapanu Esta kayowera kayi na mfalumi, kaliyasa pasi pamagulu ga mfalumi, agawu pakalira, kamluwa mfalumi kagaleweleri makontola galii Hamani mwana gwa Agagi, kafiliti kuwatendera Wayahudi. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" />Mfalumi kamtalipisiya Esta luhonga lwakuyi lwa zahabu na yomberi Esta kagoloka na kulonga, <verse eid="EST 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" />“Gwee mfalumi paguwona handa ikufiriziya na pagunjimilira nikuluwa gubweri kulewelera shakalagaliriti Hamani. Mipangu ayi ndo ilii ya mwana gwa Amedata, mzukulu gwa Agagi shakapangiti kuwalaga Wayahudi woseri mumiji yoseri ya mfalumi. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Toziya, mbeza hashi kuhepelera kuwona wantu wa neni wankwagamiziwa na walongu wa neni wankulaguwa?”<verse eid="EST 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Mfalumi Ahasuero kamgambira malikiya Esta na Modekai yakaweriti Myahudi, “Guloli! Nimpanana Esta lunda ya Hamani na yomberi wamkongera kumtera gwa kulagira <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" />Su mlembi lagaliru limonga kwa litawu lya mfalumi kwa wayahudi ntambu yamfira. Shakapanu guyituli shimaniziwu sha peti ya mfalumi, toziya libwera palilaviwa kwa litawu lya mfalumi na kutula shimaniziwu sha mfalumi, hapeni ligalambulwi.”<verse eid="EST 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" />Su, mulishaka lya ishilini na tatu lya mwezi gwa tatu yagushemuwa Siwani, Modekai kawashemiti walemba woseri wa mfalumi, kawalagalira walembi baluwa kwa Wayahudi, wakulu, wakolamlima na wakulu wa mikowa yoseri miya ishilini na saba, kwanjira India mpaka Isiopia. Baluwa azi zilembitwi kwa kila mji kwa luga yawu na ntambu yawalemba, ntambu iraa kwa Wayahudi kwa luga yawu na ntambu yawalemba. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" />Modekai kaweriti kalemba baluwa azi kwa litawu lya mfalumi Ahasuero, kazimatika shimaniziwu kwa peti ya mfalumi. Na wantu yawazipelekiti waweriti wantumintumi wakwena farasi wana likakala yawatuga nentu.<verse eid="EST 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11" />Kupitira baluwa azi mfalumi kawajimiriti Wayahudi mukila miji kujojonika pamuhera su kugalolera makaliru gawu. Wajimiritwi kuhalibisiya, kulaga pota lusungu na kwagamiziya shipinga shoseri sha wantu ama mji, gwagwiziti kuwakomanga womberi, wadala wawu na wana wawu na kulopola lunda zawu. <verse eid="EST 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12" />Mlandu agu megutendeki mumiji yoseri ya mfalumi Ahasuero, mlishaka lya kumi na tatu lya mwezi gwa kumi na mbili, yagushemwa mwezi gwa Adari. <verse eid="EST 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" />Nakala ya libweru iweriti ilaviwi handa lagiru mukila mkowa na iwezi kumanikana kwa wantu wa kila isi, su wayahudi waweri kala mulishaka ali kuwawuzilira wankondu wawu. <verse eid="EST 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Kwa lagiru ya mfalumi, wantumintumi yawakweniti farasi wana likakala yawatuga nentu, wawukiti mbiru. Libweru ali viraa lilaviwitwi mumji mkulu gwa Susa.<verse eid="EST 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" />Modekai kawukiti kulongolu kwa mfalumi, pakawera kavalira nguwu ya shifalumi ya rangi ya buluwu na nfufu, lihabiti lifufu liherepa lya langi ya zambalawu na lijenjeri likulu lya zahabu, wantu wa mji gwa Susa wafyapiliriti kwa nemeleru. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />Kwa Wayahudi kuweriti na nemeru na wantu wamonga wawapananiti ligoya. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" />Mukila mkowa na kila pahala libwera ali palisomitwi, Wayahudi wanemeleliti na kufyapilira, watenda sheleku na woyera na wantu wamonga wavuwa walitenditi kuwera Wayahudi, toziya wawatiriti nentu Wayahudi.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wankuwalaga wankondu wawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />Palisokiti lishaka lya kumi na tatu lya mwezi gwa kumi na mbili, mwezi yagushemwa Adari, lishaka lya libweru lya mfalumi melibwerwi, nawankondu wa Wayahudi watumbiriti kuwakanka Wayahudi, kumbiti lishaka ali Wayahudi wawakankiti wankondu wawu. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" />Wayahudi walijojoniriti mumiji yawu yayiwera mumikowa yoseri ya mfalumi Ahasuero kuwakomanga woseri walii yawaweriti wafira kuwalaga. Kwahera muntu yoseri yakaweziti kulikomanga na womberi, toziya wantu wa isi zimonga wawatiriti. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Na wakulu woseri wa mikowa na wakolamlima na wakulu wa mashonta na wantumintumi wa mfalumi viraa wawatangiti Wayahudi, toziya woseri wamtiriti Modekai. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Modekai kaweriti muntu yakamanika nentu munumba ya shifalumi na visoweru vyakuyi vyeneyiti mumiji yoseri, ata ukulu wakuyi wongerekiti nentu. <verse eid="EST 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Su, Wayahudi wawakomangiti wankondu wawu kwa ligumba, wawalikitula na wawagamiziya na wawatendera ntambu yawafira walii yawawakalaliriti.<verse eid="EST 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Aku kumji gwa Susa, Wayahudi wawalaga wapalu miya mhanu. <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7" />Viraa wawalagiti Parishandata na Dalifoni na Asipata, <verse eid="EST 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8" />Porata na Adalia na Aridata, <verse eid="EST 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9" />Parimashita na Arisai na Aridai na Waizata, <verse eid="EST 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10" />Awa waweriti wana lilongu wa Hamani yakaweriti mnkondu gwa wayahudi na Hamani ayu kaweriti mwana gwa wa Hamedata. Ata hangu wawapokandiri vintu vyawu.<verse eid="EST 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Lishaka liraali, mfalumi kagambirwa walanga ya wantu yawalagitwi mumji mkulu gwa Susa. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamgambira malikiya Esta, “Mumji mkulu gweka yakuyi Wayahudi wawalaga wapalu miya mhanu, pamuhera na wana lilongu wa Hamani. Watenda hashi kumiji yimonga aku? Gufira shishi vinu? Gung'ambili shagufira na gwenga hagupananwi. Gung'ambili shintu shimonga na neni hanikutenderi.”<verse eid="EST 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" />Esta kamwankula, “Gwee mfalumi, paguwona iherepa, shirawu guwajimiri Wayahudi yawawera Susa watendi ntambu yawatenditi leru. Kayi, gulagaliri wana lilongu wa Hamani wakongerwi mumtera gwa kulagira.” <verse eid="EST 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" />Mfalumi kalagaliriti aga gatendeki na libweru lilaviwa kumji gwa Susa. Wana lilongu wa Hamani wakongerwa agawu wantu pawawawona. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" />Lishaka lya kumi na msheshi lya mwezi gwa Adari, Wayahudi wajojonikiti kayi, wawalagiti wantu nentu ya miya tatu kumji gwa Susa. Kumbiti walopolandiri vintu vyawu.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />Wayahudi yawaweriti mumikowa womberi viraa walijojoniriti kugalolera makaliru gawu. Walopuluwa kulawa kwa wankondu wawu, wawalagiti wantu elufu sabini na mhanu, kumbiti watolitindiri vintu vyawu. <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />Lishaka ali liweriti lya lilongu na tatu lya mwezi gwa Adari. Lishaka lyalifatiti lya lilongu na msheshi, woyiriti, walitenditi lishaka ali kuwera lya msambu na sheleku. <verse eid="EST 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Wayahudi wa mji mkulu gwa Susa wajojonikiti pamuhera mulishaka lya kumi na tatu na lishaka lya kumi na msheshi, kumbiti lishaka lya kumi na mhanu woyiriti na kunemelera. <verse eid="EST 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" />Toziya ayi, Wayahudi yawalikala muvijiji na mumiji mididini watenda msambu lishaka lya kumi na msheshi lya mwezi gwa Adari kuwera msambu gwa nemeleru na kulijegerana mafupu.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa ukanka wa Wayahudi kwa wankondu wawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Modekai kalembiti mirandu yoseri ayi, shakapanu kawapelekeriti baluwa Wayahudi woseri yawalikaliti mumikowa ya mfalumi Ahasuero yawalikala pakwegera na kutali. <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />Kawagambiriti kila shinja watendi msambu, lishaka lya kumi na msheshi na lishaka lya kumi na mhanu lya mwezi gwa Adari, <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />toziya mumashaka aga mawili, Wayahudi wawakankiti wankondu wawu. Na hinginika yawu igalambulitwi kuwera nemeleru, viwembu vyawu vigalambulwa kuwera msambu. Walagaliritwi wagaholi mashaka aga kwa kutenda msambu, walipanani mafupu ga shiboga na kuwapanana vintu wahushu. <verse eid="EST 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Hangu, Wayahudi walijimirana kutenda ntambu yawanjiti na handa Modekai ntambu yakawalembiriti.<verse eid="EST 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" />Hamani mnkondu gwa Wayahudi na viraa kaweriti mwana gwa Hamedata gwa lukolu lwa Agagi, kaweriti katenda mpangu kawalagi Wayahudi, viraa kagalambula simbi yazishemwa Puri, su kawoni lishaka lya kuwaposholanga na kuwalaga Wayahudi. <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" />Kumbiti Esta pakamgendiriti mfalumi na yomberi mfalumi kalagaliriti kulemba makontola galii gakatenditi Hamani kwa Wayahudi, gampati mweni, na wana wakuyi wakongerwi kumtera gwa kulagira. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26" />Hangu, wagashemiti mashaka aga Purimu, kulawirana na shisoweru Puri kwa litawu limonga lishemwa kugalambula simbi. Toziya ya baluwa ya Modekai na mirandu yawawoniti weni na galii gagawapatiti, <verse eid="EST 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27" />Wayahudi watenditi msambu kuwera jadi yawu, kwa wiwuka wawu na kwa muntu yoseri yakawera pamuhera na womberi, kuwera mumashaka yagasyagulitwi, kila shinja mashaka aga mawili ganemelerwi ntambu yakalagalira Modekai. <verse eid="EST 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Viravirii wajimilaniti kuwera kila kaya ya Shiyahudi, kulawa shiyiwuku shimu mpaka shimonga, mukila mikowa na kila mji, liholuwi lishaka lya kugalambula simbi na kutenda msambu mashaka goseri.<verse eid="EST 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />Shakapanu malikiya Esta, muhinga gwa Abihaili, pamuhera na Modekai Myahudi, kalembiti baluwa muukulu wakuyi, handa wavimani kuwera baluwa ayi ya pili iweriti toziya ya msambu gwa kugalambula simbi. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" />Baluwa azi walemberitwi Wayahudi woseri yawalikala kumiji yoseri miya yimu ishilini na saba ya ukolamlima wa Ahasuero. Baluwa azi ziwafililiti Wayahudi ponga na matumbiru. <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" />Baluwa azi viraa ziwafiliti kugangamaziya mashaka aga ga kugalambula simbi muvipindi vyakuyi vyavitulitwi, handa Modekai myahudi na malikiya Esta ntambu yakalagaliriti na ntambu yawaligangamaziyiti weni na wiwuka wawu mushaka sha koya kuliya na kudaya. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Baluwa azi za Esta zilanguziya mirandu ayi ya Purimu na yeni ilembwa mushitabu sha maholu.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Modekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Mfalumi Ahasuero kawalagaliliti wantu woseri yawalikala muisi na kuvisiwa walipi kodi. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" />Matendu gakuyi goseri makulu mfalumi gakatenditi pamuhera na tambiru zoseri zakampananiti ukulu Modekai na kumpanana ligoya likulu, goseri galembwa mushitabu sha maholu ga wafalumi wa Mediya na Perisia. <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" />Modekai yakaweriti Myahudi, kaweriti gwa pili kulawa ukulu wa mfalumi Ahasuero. Kafilitwi na wavuwa na kupananwa ligoya na Wayahudi, toziya kawatenderiti maheri wantu wakuyi na kuwaluwira ponga wiwuka wawu woseri.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>